    "answer_en": "I connect documentation to operational events: no production release without updated diagrams and runbooks; incident reviews update known errors; access reviews update role matrices; DR tests update recovery steps. I use templates, ownership, review dates and small searchable pages rather than a single large document. A new team member should be able to perform a safe handover using it.",
